    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Cutoﬀ describes a phase transition: as we run the family of Markov chains on Xn, the total variation distance is almost equal to 1, and then suddenly it drops and approaches zero as n goes to inﬁnity. The formal deﬁnition of cutoﬀ is given below."
