    "font size" : 11.955,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Given a Markov chain exhibiting cutoﬀ, one can ask for more precise control on the exact distance from stationarity. This is known as the limit proﬁle with respect to the sequences (tn) and (wn), deﬁned as:"
